          "content": "<section class=\"story\"><h1>雾港来信</h1><img src=\"../assets/portrait.svg\" alt=\"雾港夜景\"><p id=\"location\"></p><button id=\"latest\">返回最新状态</button><div id=\"chat\"></div></section>"
